# Project rules: Portfolio site

- Each project is a Markdown file in one content folder. Pages read from those files. No project text hard-coded in components.
- Static output only. No server, database, or login.
- Images go in one folder with descriptive file names and alt text.
- Keep the design to one font pair and a small color palette defined in one CSS file.
- Every page needs a unique <title> and meta description.
- Ask before adding a CSS framework, UI library, or animation library.
